        "## Main Topics\n",
        "- Logistic regression in more detail\n",
        "- Interpreting probabilities\n",
        "- Thresholds and classification decisions\n",
        "- Comparing classifiers\n",
        "\n",
        "## Teaching Goals\n",
        "Students should learn how binary classification models convert predictors into class probabilities and final decisions.\n",
        "## Suggested Emphasis\n",
        "- Distinguish between probability estimation and hard classification.\n",
        "- Discuss how different thresholds change predictions.\n",
        "- Use practical examples such as disease detection or spam filtering.\n",
