        "- Validation set approach\n",
        "- Cross-validation\n",
        "- Bootstrap\n",
        "- Estimating test error\n",
        "\n",
        "## Teaching Goals\n",
        "This unit is the conceptual center of the course. Students must understand that **training error is not enough**, and that model performance must be evaluated using principled estimates of test error.\n",
