        "- Compare subset selection and shrinkage conceptually.\n",
        "- Use coefficient path plots when possible.\n",
        "\n",
        "# Unit 9: Ensemble Methods\n",
        "## Main Topics\n",
        "- Decision trees\n",
        "- Bagging\n",
        "- Random forests\n",
        "- Boosting\n",
        "\n",
        "## Teaching Goals\n",
        "Students should learn that combining many unstable or weak learners can create a stronger predictive model.\n",
